    "constraints": {
      "subsystem_count": "multiple",
      "caller_simplification": "single_entry_point",
      "coupling_to_subsystems": "hidden_behind_facade",
      "lifecycle": "facade_owns_or_borrows_subsystems"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "子系统只有一个或接口本来就很简单时，外观是多余的间接",
      "调用方确实需要精细控制各子系统时，外观会挡路，应提供底层直连路径"
    ],
